Generates a list of all existing, new and defunct drugs.

1) Run load_data.php
  This will download the LNHPD JSON data from the Health Canada Drug Product Database (DPD):
  https://health-products.canada.ca/api/natural-licences/productlicence?lang=en&type=json
  It will then put the relevant data into the patrick_sandbox.lnhpd_product table (replacing the existing table).

2) Run generate_csv.php
  This will generate the file "lnhpd.<date>.csv" that can be uploaded to Pine.
  All existing entries will be overwritten and any missing will be added.
  Note that no indicators are ever provided by this utility (by design).
